    "forum": {
        "leads": [
            "Fornits lead (lawsuit): A lawsuit was filed by parents against Rebekah Home for Girls after staff member Sherri Compton molested a student, which ended in an out-of-court settlement. (Fornits forum, post by Anonymous, January 2005: https://www.fornits.com/phpbb/index.php?topic=2107.118)",
            "Fornits lead (investigation): Abuse charges led to continuous criminal charges, investigations, and lawsuits against the Roloff homes. (Fornits forum, post by Anonymous, June 2004: https://www.fornits.com/phpbb/index.php?topic=2107.37)",
            "Fornits lead (investigation): Texas monthly article reported that Mrs. Cameron was banned from working in childcare facilities in Texas. (Fornits forum, post by Anonymous, November 2004: https://www.fornits.com/phpbb/index.php?topic=2107.98)",
            "Fornits lead (news): A 20/20 television crew visited the facility with cameras while residents were in the exercise yard. (Fornits forum, post by Anonymous, March 2004: https://www.fornits.com/phpbb/index.php?topic=2107.11)",
            "Fornits lead (lawsuit): Parents settled out of court with the Home after a student was molested by staff member Sherri Compton. (Fornits forum, post by Anonymous, January 2005: https://www.fornits.com/phpbb/index.php?topic=2107.118)",
            "Fornits lead (other): A Yahoo group exists for survivors from different Roloff homes. http://groups.yahoo.com/group/roloffhomes/ (Fornits forum, post by Anonymous, July 2004: https://www.fornits.com/phpbb/index.php?topic=2107.54)",
            "Fornits lead (investigation): A Texas Monthly article by Pamela Coloff detailed allegations of abuse and noted that Mrs. Cameron was banned by the State of Texas from working in child care facilities. (Fornits forum, post by Anonymous, July 2004: https://www.fornits.com/phpbb/index.php?topic=2107.61)",
            "Fornits lead (investigation): A Texas Monthly article by Pamela Coloff detailed numerous allegations of abuse against Mrs. Cameron and noted she was banned by the State of Texas from working in child care facilities. http://www.nospank.net/colloff.htm (Fornits forum, post by Anonymous, August 2004: https://www.fornits.com/phpbb/index.php?topic=2107.69)",
            "Fornits lead (news): A 20/20 news crew visited the facility with cameras. (Fornits forum, post by Anonymous, March 2004: https://www.fornits.com/phpbb/index.php?topic=2107.11)",
            "Fornits lead (lawsuit): Texas banned Mrs. Cameron from working in childcare facilities. (Fornits forum, post by Anonymous, November 2004: https://www.fornits.com/phpbb/index.php?topic=2107.98)"
        ],
        "links": [
            {
                "url": "https://www.fornits.com/phpbb/index.php?topic=2107.0",
                "label": "Fornits: Lester Roloffs Rebekah Home for Girls Survivors-Cult-mindcon (2003-2015, 1260 posts). Former residents describe it as a cult-like facility run under Lester Roloff's ministry where girls faced extreme isolation, restraints, and forced scripture memorization, while defenders credit the home with saving their lives and providing Christian guidance."
            }
        ]
